OL,3,GNEWSA'We're a pretty good duo': Meet
OL,4,Athe tennis doubles pair with a 66-year
OL,5,Aage gap
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey may be 66 years apart in age, but
OL,8,Fon the tennis court David McCandless
OL,9,Fand his doubles partner Liam have
OL,10,Fdeveloped a partnership that has proved
OL,11,Fa winning combination.
OL,13,FThe 80-year-old and his 14-year-old
OL,14,Fcounterpart teamed up two years ago and
OL,15,Fhave not looked back since.
OL,17,FSince then, the unlikely pairing have
OL,18,Fwon more than half of their North West
OL,19,Fof Ireland league games - after ironing
OL,20,Fout a few kinks.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
