OL,3,GNEWSA'We're a pretty good duo': Meet
OL,4,Athe tennis doubles pair with a 66-year
OL,5,Aage gap
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We started on court and it was a case
OL,8,Fof who is going to go where," Liam
OL,9,Fsaid. "Then after a couple of matches
OL,10,Fwe started winning because we realised
OL,11,Fwe got a system down and we realised we
OL,12,Fare a pretty good duo."
